  "remarks": "JSC Pavlik is one of the largest Russian gold mining companies in the Far East, which is ranked among the top 10 gold mining companies in the Russian Federation It holds a licence for prospecting, exploration, and mining of gold ore at the Pavlik deposit in the Magadan Region. The export of precious metals is one of the most significant sources of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. As of 2025, Russia is the second largest gold producing country in the world. Therefore, JSC Pavlik is involved in economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
